      <div class="cp-pitch-card">
        <!-- Headline -->
        <h3 class="cp-pitch-headline">Learn Interior Design. Build a Skill AI Can’t Easily Replace.</h3>

        <!-- Hook -->
        <div class="cp-pitch-hook">
          <div class="cp-pitch-hook-title">🚨 Is Your Design Skill Still Not Paying You Enough?</div>
          <div class="cp-pitch-hook-lead">The industry is changing fast.</div>
          <p class="cp-pitch-hook-desc">AI is making basic designs, renders and concepts faster than ever. Knowing one software or creating average-looking designs is no longer enough to stand out.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Pain points -->
        <div class="cp-pitch-pain-list">
          <div class="cp-pitch-pain-item">
            <span class="cp-pitch-pain-icon">❌</span>
            <span>Struggling to make good income with basic design skills</span>
          </div>
          <div class="cp-pitch-pain-item">
            <span class="cp-pitch-pain-icon">❌</span>
            <span>Getting paid less because your designs look similar to everyone else</span>
          </div>
          <div class="cp-pitch-pain-item">
            <span class="cp-pitch-pain-icon">❌</span>
            <span>Losing clients who can now generate basic concepts with AI</span>
          </div>
          <div class="cp-pitch-pain-item">
            <span class="cp-pitch-pain-icon">❌</span>
            <span>Knowing AutoCAD or SketchUp but still unable to deliver a complete project</span>
          </div>
          <div class="cp-pitch-pain-item">
            <span class="cp-pitch-pain-icon">❌</span>
            <span>Spending hours creating designs that don't look professional enough to impress clients</span>
          </div>
          <div class="cp-pitch-pain-item">
            <span class="cp-pitch-pain-icon">❌</span>
            <span>Watching designers with better portfolios attract the clients and fees you want</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Insight -->
        <div class="cp-pitch-insight">
          👉 <strong>The problem isn't that there aren't opportunities.</strong><br>
          The problem is that basic skills are becoming easier to replace.
          <div class="cp-pitch-insight-follow">
            To stay valuable, you need to know how to plan, design, model, render and present — not just operate software.
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Solution -->
        <div class="cp-pitch-solution">
          <div class="cp-pitch-solution-title">✅ Stop Being “Just a Software User.”</div>
          <div class="cp-pitch-solution-sub">Become the Designer Who Can Deliver the Complete Project.</div>
          <div class="cp-pitch-solution-lead">Learn the complete workflow:</div>

          <!-- Pipeline -->
          <div class="cp-pitch-pipeline">
            PLAN <span>→</span> DESIGN <span>→</span> 3D MODEL <span>→</span> RENDER <span>→</span> PRESENT
          </div>

          <p class="cp-pitch-software">
            <strong>Master:</strong> AutoCAD + SketchUp + V-Ray + D5 + Enscape + AI<br>
            And learn how to combine them to create professional Interior &amp; Exterior projects.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Important Barriers Addressed -->
