              <span class="cp-pitch-barrier-icon">🎓</span>
              <div class="cp-pitch-barrier-content">
                <div class="cp-pitch-barrier-heading">No Architecture Degree or Prior 3D Skills Needed</div>
                <p class="cp-pitch-barrier-text">We start from opening the software for the first time. Every tool, setting, and shortcut is taught step-by-step from complete scratch.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="cp-pitch-barrier-item">
              <span class="cp-pitch-barrier-icon">💻</span>
              <div class="cp-pitch-barrier-content">
                <div class="cp-pitch-barrier-heading">Zero Expensive Software Licenses to Buy</div>
                <p class="cp-pitch-barrier-text">Official setup guides included inside to access student, educational, and free trial community versions for SketchUp, V-Ray, D5, and AutoCAD (Windows &amp; Mac).</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="cp-pitch-barrier-item">
              <span class="cp-pitch-barrier-icon">⚡</span>
              <div class="cp-pitch-barrier-content">
                <div class="cp-pitch-barrier-heading">First 4K Photorealistic Render in Under 14 Days</div>
                <p class="cp-pitch-barrier-text">Skip months of dry textbook theory. Follow our guided project workflow to create a portfolio-ready 3D render in your very first two weeks.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

